/* Authored level hints */
"Panda starts above the bed. Clear the wooden layers without tipping her sideways." = "熊貓就在床的上方。移除一層層木塊時，盡量不要讓她向兩側傾斜。";
"The wide top plank rests on two sides. Keep its support balanced as you open the middle." = "頂部的寬木板由兩側支撐。清理中間的通道時，注意保持支撐平衡。";
"Panda is above the left side of a wide structure. Focus on the path beneath her rather than clearing every block." = "熊貓位於整個寬支架的左上方。重點清理她下方的通道，不必移除所有木塊。";
"Panda starts to the right of the bed. Think about how the overlapping planks can bring her toward the center." = "熊貓從床的右上方出發。想一想，交疊的木板怎樣才能把她引向中間。";
"The square blocks form an offset stack. Removing a lower block changes the balance of everything above it." = "方塊錯位堆疊在一起。移除下層方塊會改變上方所有物體的平衡。";
"Panda starts on the left. The two narrow supports under her top block can change which way she leans." = "熊貓從左側出發。頂部方塊下的兩根窄支柱會影響她傾斜的方向。";
"Panda rests on the high right plank. The lower planks can help her descend toward the bed." = "熊貓在右側較高的木板上。下方的木板可以幫助她朝床的方向下降。";
"The top block rests on upright planks. Watch how removing one support changes the block's balance." = "頂部方塊由直立木板支撐。留意移除一側支撐後，方塊的平衡會怎樣變化。";
"Panda starts far to the left of the bed. A straight drop may miss; use the supporting plank to guide her inward." = "熊貓離床的左側很遠。直接落下可能會錯過床，試著用支撐木板引導她向中間移動。";
"The gray stone pieces move as one structure. Clear a landing path before removing that support." = "灰色石塊會作為一個整體移動。移除這組支撐前，先清理好落向床的通道。";
"Panda starts on the right. Compare the two narrow supports before choosing which side to release." = "熊貓從右側出發。先比較兩根窄支柱，再決定從哪一側開始移除。";
"Panda rests on the high left plank. Use the lower planks to guide her toward the bed." = "熊貓在左側較高的木板上。利用下方木板引導她朝床的方向移動。";
"Panda starts far to the right of the bed. Think about the direction the long plank will tilt." = "熊貓離床的右側很遠。想一想，長木板會朝哪個方向傾斜。";
"Clear the wooden block above the bed, then remove the top plank." = "先移除床上方的木塊，再移除頂部木板。";
"Clear the center block, then remove the upper plank. Let Panda settle before removing the lower plank." = "先移除中間的木塊，再移除上層木板。等熊貓平穩後，再移除下層木板。";
"Clear the wooden blocks above the bed first. The stone bridge disappears as one piece when tapped." = "先移除床上方的木塊。點擊石橋時，所有石塊會一起消失。";
